completed_at: "2026-09-03T17:23:08.517Z"
claim_principal: codex
author: pi-agent
resolution: "Added test 'the launcher runs the gate and sets a failing exit code on an unattested publish when it is the entry point' to test/verify-release-publish-attestation.test.ts. The test calls runIfMain with argv[1] and moduleUrl both set to the launcher's own path against a git-initialized fixture with an unattested publish, asserting return is true and process.exitCode is 1. Regression proven both ways: removing process.exitCode assignment fails with undefined !== 1; skipping the gate fails with false !== true. All 220 tests pass, coverage at 100%."
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-03T17:21:05.539Z",codex,"PR #101 review threads (greptile P2 + cubic P2) both flagged that the direct-execution path of the attestation gate launcher was untested. The existing suite only exercised the not-main branch of runIfMain (returns false). Added a test that calls runIfMain with argv[1] and moduleUrl both set to the launcher's own path against a git-initialized fixture with an unattested publish, asserting return is true and process.exitCode is 1. Regression proven: removing process.exitCode = code from the launcher causes the test to fail with undefined !== 1; making runIfMain skip the gate causes false !== true."
